abstract: >-
  Manuscript (conference and full versions), finite exact-arithmetic checks, and a
  Lean 4 formalization with Mathlib for exact sampling from neural networks: query
  and bit complexity of sampling tanh networks, indexed attention over finite caches,
  RMS normalization, and an exact maintained autoregressive decoder.
